    {
      "segment_id": "seg-001",
      "sequence": 0,
      "speaker_id": "spk_0",
      "start_time": 0.0,
      "end_time": 14.5,
      "text": "Good morning team. Today we need to resolve the database and vector storage architecture for MeetingOS."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "seg-002",
      "sequence": 1,
      "speaker_id": "spk_1",
      "start_time": 15.0,
      "end_time": 42.8,
      "text": "Yesterday I finished the benchmark comparison between MongoDB and PostgreSQL with pgvector. We noticed intermittent connection pooling timeouts with MongoDB during high-concurrency ingestion tests."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "seg-003",
      "sequence": 2,
      "speaker_id": "spk_2",
      "start_time": 43.5,
      "end_time": 75.0,
      "text": "Furthermore, PostgreSQL allows us to keep our relational entity graph and dense vector embeddings in a single ACID store, which eliminates dual-write synchronization complexity."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "seg-004",
      "sequence": 3,
      "speaker_id": "spk_0",
      "start_time": 76.2,
      "end_time": 98.4,
      "text": "That makes complete sense. Let us officially decide to adopt PostgreSQL 16 with pgvector as our primary organizational memory store."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "seg-005",
      "sequence": 4,
      "speaker_id": "spk_0",
      "start_time": 99.0,
      "end_time": 120.5,
      "text": "Rahul, please finalize the initial SQLAlchemy models and Alembic migrations by Friday August 28."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "seg-006",
      "sequence": 5,
      "speaker_id": "spk_1",
      "start_time": 121.0,
      "end_time": 135.2,
      "text": "I will deliver the database foundation and Common Meeting Format schemas by Friday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "seg-007",
      "sequence": 6,
      "speaker_id": "spk_2",
      "start_time": 136.0,
      "end_time": 158.0,
      "text": "I will take the action item to evaluate sentence-transformers and faster-whisper on our local development hardware next week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "seg-008",
      "sequence": 7,
      "speaker_id": "spk_0",
      "start_time": 159.0,
      "end_time": 172.5,
      "text": "Excellent. We will reconvene next Monday to review the initial Phase 0 test results."
    }
